        <mj-text align="justify" font-size="14px" color="#142328" padding-top="4px">
          Stop re-explaining context to AI every time you open a new chat. This 3-hour live workshop with <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/s-carolinalago/" style="color:#142328;font-weight:bold;">Carolina Lago</a> teaches you to build reusable Claude Skills for budgeting, forecasting, and variance analysis. No coding required. You leave with a working system, not a slide deck.
