    <!-- Featured post card -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://bibb.pro/images/blog/heros/how-to-design-better-kpis.png" href="https://bibb.pro/post/how-to-design-better-kpis/" border-radius="6px" padding-bottom="16px" />
        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold" color="#142328" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="8px">
          How to Design Better KPIs Before They Mislead You
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#555555">
          Your KPI can be accurate, on target, and still wrong. This post shows why formula incompleteness is the failure mode most dashboards never name, and how to stress-test any metric before it locks into your reporting cycle. Includes three DAX measures and a real case study.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://bibb.pro/post/how-to-design-better-kpis/" align="left" padding-top="10px" padding-bottom="6px" background-color="#FF0020">
          Go to featured post
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Divider -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-color="#e0e0e0" border-width="1px" padding="0" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Auth announcement -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 40px 8px">
