    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-weight="bold" color="#142328" padding-bottom="4px">
          How signing in works
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          There is a new Sign in button in the top-right corner of the site. Click it, enter your email, and that's it. Within seconds, a magic link arrives in your inbox. Click it and you're signed in. No password, no account setup, no confirmation step beyond that one click. The site remembers exactly where you were before you signed in and returns you there automatically.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-weight="bold" color="#142328" padding-bottom="4px">
          What signing in unlocks
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          The first thing gated behind sign-in is the Theme Generator JSON export. Previously, downloading your generated theme required submitting your email through a separate form. That form is now replaced by your account. If you are a bibb subscriber, the export button is available as soon as you're signed in. No extra steps. If your account email is not on the subscriber list yet, the user menu shows a direct link to subscribe and a refresh button to re-check your status once you have confirmed.
