          We updated our Privacy Policy to v2.1 alongside this release. What changed: we explain what is stored when you sign in (your email address and a session token, nothing else), we disclose that your email is checked against the subscriber list to verify your access tier and that the result is cached locally for 24 hours, and we added Supabase, the authentication provider, to our list of third-party processors. Your authentication data is hosted in Zurich, Switzerland. You can request account deletion at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:contact_bibb@bibb.pro" style="color:#FF0020;">contact_bibb@bibb.pro</a>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
